1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
This is Causabee.

2
00:00:02,823 --> 00:00:09,733
Mail, screenshots, photos, letters, notes —
it turns all the pieces into clear matters.

3
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:19,040
Let’s follow one of them — Mum’s care, after her fall —
through one day, on the Mac, the iPad, and the iPhone.

4
00:00:19,107 --> 00:00:21,360
In the morning, you open your Mac.

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,920
What came in overnight is already read,
and waits on top of its matter.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Before anything went to the AI,
names and numbers were swapped for placeholders, right on your Mac.

7
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:36,960
Dr. Brandt became Person A,
and Helga became Person B.

8
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:40,240
The AI only ever sees the disguise.

9
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:44,800
All that’s left for you is a look:
what is new, and what it brings.

10
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:48,800
Gather the papers for the visit? One tap,
and it’s in your plan.

11
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:53,040
Every matter has one next step,
and the reason it can’t wait.

12
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:57,280
And the plan: when each thing is due,
and where it came from.

13
00:00:57,347 --> 00:01:02,080
In the afternoon, you’re at Mum’s,
with the iPad. Tick off what’s done.

14
00:01:02,213 --> 00:01:06,640
Through your own iCloud,
it’s ticked off on your iPhone and your Mac as well.

15
00:01:06,707 --> 00:01:12,560
There’s paper, too. A letter from Mum’s health insurer:
her own share of the hospital stay.

16
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:22,400
Scan it with your iPhone. The bee reads it, and one tap sorts it in:
the letter into Mum’s matter, and a task — pay her share by the end of the month.

17
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:29,600
On the way home, pull down on your iPhone. The bee flies in,
and what came in since is sorted into its matters.

18
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:33,440
Then just ask:
what do I need to do before Tuesday’s visit?

19
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:39,360
The answer comes with its sources.
And a good suggestion becomes a task, with one tap.

20
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:46,583
In the evening, back at the Mac, it’s all there:
what you ticked off on the iPad, and what you added on the iPhone.

21
00:01:46,697 --> 00:01:52,240
What comes in stays on your devices,
and goes with you through your own iCloud.

22
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:55,840
Causabee. Be organized. Be private.
